WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.440
If I don't return this quickly...

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.440
Not returning what you borrow... what scum.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.360
That's what she'd say.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.910
Sorry to make you wait, Wassan.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.450
Hey, a handkerchief, thanks.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.710
Why?

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.620
It doesn't matter when

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.050
I always think of your smile

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:49.520
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:54.720
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:58.200
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.940
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:05.690
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.550
I will always be your side

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:15.430
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:18.990
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:24.660
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:29.520
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:39.450
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:35.550
bokutachi wa nani mo kawarazu ni

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.450
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.900
In the same world

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.900
onaji kono sekai ni ite

00:01:54.900 --> 00:02:00.170
Sixth Longsword

00:01:55.860 --> 00:02:00.170
Wassan Appears!

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.140
I did something terrible to Torigaya.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.310
Even so, I need to return this handkerchief quickly.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.350
How should I...

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:10.940
Maybe in the classroom?

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.440
No, it's too embarrassing to return this in front of everyone.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.690
Stop right there, Yoichi-san!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:17.950
It was a misunderstanding!

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:18.990
Ikaruga-san!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.570
And the shitty samurai.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.910
How can you get a nosebleed in an art class?

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.290
The sculpture was of a naked lady!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.250
It's because you have a rotten heart!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.290
Reflect on your actions!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.290
There's the samurai, but this is my chance!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.420
Ukiha Kamikaze Sword style, 4th Technique:

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.970
Ikaruga-san, here's your...

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.760
Arashi!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.010
...handkerchief.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.430
Damn it, I missed.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.430
You're not getting away, Yoichi-san!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:50.060
Did a sharp wind just blow through the hall?

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.850
Yeah, are you okay, Wassan?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.570
I can't give it to her personally.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.440
Then...

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.740
Wait a minute...

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.780
If I put a letter in there too,

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.660
I'll be killing two birds with one stone.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.580
If I do that...

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:12.080
I read your letter, Washizu-kun.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.330
I love you.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.590
Me too!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.590
Let's go home together today.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.590
Okay.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.300
That's completely perfect!

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.600
Does this kid have other problems I should look at?

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.970
No, he gets weird like this sometimes.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.270
You never get tired, do you?

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.150
You're really terrible, Yoichi-san!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:35.190
Ibuki-dono, you're also as violent as ever.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.480
What was that?!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.360
Oh, nothing.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.990
Ikaruga-san.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.830
While everyone was avoiding a delinquent like me, you were the first one to talk to me.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.540
Washizu-kun, you're cleaning today, right?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.840
Wow.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.130
Washizu's cleaning.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.300
Even after that, you greeted me.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.930
Washizu-kun, good morning.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:05.720
Good morning.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:11.730
Every time I saw your smile, I came to like you more and more.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:16.520
Today I will tell you my feelings that have accumulated within me.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.110
She's here.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.730
Ikaruga-san!

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.740
What?!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.740
I put it in the wrong one?!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.250
Washizu-dono, this letter...

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.750
Could it be that you...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.870
He knows?!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.920
He knows my feelings toward Ikaruga-san.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.960
No, this is a good chance.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.710
I'll burn it directly into this shitty samurai's brain...

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.640
...that I'm not gonna let him snatch away Ikaruga-san!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:47.800
I...

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.310
...like-

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:48.850
Could you be...

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.640
interested in martial arts?

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.640
No, I was...

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.480
That's why you've always been looking at Ibuki-dono.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.360
trying to...

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.650
You want to join the Ikaruga dojo.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.110
Hey, listen to me!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.150
I don't give a damn about martial arts!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.150
Because you...

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.200
have very good fists.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.620
Right, Ibuki-dono?

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.790
I-Ikaruga-san.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:16.120
Washizu-kun, you should've told me.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.250
I'm sure you'll improve really quickly.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.800
Come join the dojo!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.590
Yes, I will!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:24.550
That's great!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:26.880
But...

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:31.140
I wonder why he asked you to give this back to me.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:36.020
Martial artists discuss their problems with past enemies.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.140
That's a new one.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.440
Now the dojo will be even more lively.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.650
Isn't that great, Ibuki-dono?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.200
Is something wrong?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:54.870
Yoichi-san, I used to dislike morning cleaning.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:59.290
It was lonely being by myself in that vast dojo.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:03.300
But now, I can't wait for the morning cleaning.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.920
It's changed so much since you came.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.470
What's wrong?

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.090
Nothing.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:14.180
Would she hit me again if I...

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.640
said that her smile just now was really cute?

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.860
Wassan!

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.400
Are you done?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:26.190
Torigaya, martial arts are really cool!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.610
Huh? First time hearing that.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.590
Splendid.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.350
I expect nothing less from the successor of Yamigarasu Anten style,

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:59.230
Nuezume Jinjuurou, an assassin that can even cut through darkness.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.520
The heir of Karasuma left the mountain?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.150
Correct.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.610
Even as a student like yourself,

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:12.700
he is planning to show the world that Ukiha Kamikaze style is the samurai of the present.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:17.500
If Ukiha Kamikaze style is the light, then Yamigarasu is the shadow.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.750
For you guys who have been rivaling each other on the path to true strength,

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.090
don't you find such advertising acts unforgivable?

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:30.720
As a lover of martial arts, I, myself, cannot let this pass.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:35.050
Jinjuurou, I will help you.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.520
In killing Karasuma Yoichi,

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.310
I will present you with this reward.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:47.440
What are you-

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.110
There is no need for cash.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.950
If what you say is true, I will simply face him and kill him.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.580
Nothing more.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.460
I should've sent him from the start.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:12.130
Karasuma Yoichi, the strongest assassin with a sharper blade than yours will appear before you.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:14.920
Washizu Vision

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:24.850
How hideous.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.860
Have a nice trip

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.280
I leave the house to you...

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.160
while I'm away.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.910
I really showed up...

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.170
Wassan, are you really gonna do this?

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.710
Do you want to be a martial artist?

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:46.880
Of course not!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:50.670
I hate martial artists.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.340
Not long ago, you said martial arts are cool...

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.510
Then why?

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.930
Why are we here?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.090
I don't get it.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.550
Shut up!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.640
Then go home.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.470
Don't be so cold.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.850
You and I are real friends.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.060
Real-

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:05.980
What the?

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.570
Stop talking in front of the gate.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.730
We can't get through.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.650
Who the hell are you?

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.650
We're students here.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:15.740
What about you, old man?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.740
Old man?!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.570
Hey!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.120
Wassan's not an old man!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.200
He's Wassan!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.580
I don't get it.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.250
Everyone, welcome.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.750
Ikaruga-san.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.000
Hey, Sensei!

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:30.540
Let's do our best today, too.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.050
Yeees!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.590
A dougi...

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.800
You look so lovely, Ikaruga-san.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.600
Oh, this was your place?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.560
Yes.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.970
Washizu-kun, are you starting today?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:44.600
Yes.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.350
We'll welcome you any time

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:50.520
Sensei, who are these guys?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.360
They're my friends.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.150
They'll be in the same class as you.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:58.450
Hold on, I'm just tagging along.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.450
Then they're our juniors?

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.620
I guess so, we'll have to look after them.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.160
Don't give us too much trouble, newbies.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.130
Hey, hey, don't get things started on your own.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.210
Wassan, say something.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.880
Ikaruga-san said...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.590
I was her... friend.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.260
I have absolutely nothing I regret in my life!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.640
This guy's... weird.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.730
Shut up!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.850
He gets like this sometimes.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.940
Now, let's get changed and start the lesson.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.530
I'm gonna give it my best today, too.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.320
Okay!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.070
Ikaruga-san's teaching?

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.620
Good thing I came.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:47.120
Oh yeah, Washizu-kun, your lesson will be a little different since you're new.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.730
Karasuma Yoichi.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.110
Prepare yourself for death.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.830
One, two, three, four...

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.590
Kagome, can you get me something cold?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:35.250
Sure.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:36.630
Just the usual?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.590
Yeah.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.260
Here, it's for you.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:56.400
Kagome, my books are getting an additional printing.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.610
I'll get a little more income.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.360
Then Ibuki-oneechan will be happy.

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.160
Yes, she will.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.450
Looks like they're having fun over there.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:12.620
Oh, apparently, Ibuki-oneechan's friends joined the dojo.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.040
Can I get another one?

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.750
A little thicker this time.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.800
One, two, three...

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.760
Let the voice come from your stomach!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.720
Ikaruga-san, you look beautiful in those clothes.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.470
Your heart is distracted!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:37.440
Your body is well-trained, so we should focus on training your mind.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.190
You can join everyone else after that.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.440
Stop exaggerating, I hit you with the spine.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.320
There's no difference in a wooden sword!

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.910
You bastard, let's settle this once and for all.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.410
Is something wrong, Washizu-kun?

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.370
No, nothing at all.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:53.290
Really?

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.420
That's great.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.420
If you learn from him, you're sure to succeed.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.800
Thank you, I won't fail you.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.010
All right samurai, let's get back to sitting.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.880
I'm gonna sit like crazy.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.510
That's the spirit.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.430
Yo.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:07.760
'Ello.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.430
What?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.890
You guys also students here?

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.560
We're Ibuki-nee's sisters.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.060
Are you joining today?

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.900
I'm just tagging along with Wassan.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:27.070
By the way, how many girls are in your family?

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.700
Wait, the second oldest one, what's her name...

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.700
Ayame-oneechan?

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.700
I'm home.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.120
Sorry I'm late-

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.790
What? No one's here?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.040
They should lock this place.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.340
Oh no you don't, Yoichi-san!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.920
What are they doing?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.930
You hit him too hard for just opening his eyes!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.060
Look at him, he can barely stand!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.100
I'm sorry.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.930
I did go easy on him.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.390
Don't base his training off yours.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:00.270
If you beat on the weak, you fail as a samurai.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.770
Failure?!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.150
Weak?!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.450
Oh, Wassan, be strong.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.530
It's an if, only an if.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.910
Here, stand up.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.590
Please get a hold of yourself.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.340
Geez.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.880
My apologies...

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.380
Wassan, stand up.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.680
Here, I'll seriously let you use my shoulder.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.100
Stand up.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.680
Old man, you all right?

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.680
It happens on the first day, you know.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.640
Hey, I'm not old!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:41.440
Kagome, you never show up at the dojo.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.690
Oh, yeah.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.070
Why not?

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.730
Is there a reason?

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.280
I'm not good at sports.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.820
Well, it's fine.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.520
Karasuma Yoichi, here I come.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:27.280
Since I know your strength well, we'll train you in the basics of swinging a sword,

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.110
the arm strength.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:33.030
Hey, that's the complete opposite of what you said a little earlier!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:33.950
I'm terribly sorry.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.030
He doesn't need to train.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:38.040
He was once aiming to be a boxer.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.500
The muscles used in a fist fight and a sword fight are different.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.920
Today, we'll start with the basics of the basics: push-ups.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.590
What is this, a P.E. class?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.840
Why do I have to do that?

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:51.800
Washizu-kun,

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.470
basics are important.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.010
I'll do it!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:02.230
Give me a break, I can do a hundred, no problem.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.190
What?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.270
I realized something after Ibuki-dono lectured me.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.570
I, too, am a student of the martial arts.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:13.240
I was ten years too early to teach what martial arts are.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:14.700
So what?!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:20.250
Hence, I will join you in your training and train myself from the basics.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.120
Yoichi-san...

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.250
You bastard...

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.960
You're just trying to show off in front of Ikaruga-san.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.550
That won't happen.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.170
Do whatever you want.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.010
All right, let's start.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.130
One...

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:38.310
We're buying an awful lot today.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.140
Yeah, is that okay?

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.140
I did get more income, so it's a good time to stock up.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:45.650
That's not why...

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.360
That's also fine.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.360
391!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.110
It's hot.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.450
392!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.910
393!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.870
395!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.170
396!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.420
How long are they going to continue?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.420
I don't know.

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:13.420
How many times do you actually want me to do this, you shitty samurai?

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.760
400!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.260
Done.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.180
Wassan, great job.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.270
What are you doing, samurai?

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:31.780
As a punishment for my arrogance earlier, I'll do a little bit more.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.570
He's gonna keep going?

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.070
How many times are you going to do this?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.530
It won't be a punishment if I don't suffer.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.330
I shall do twice my usual, just about a thousand.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.700
A thousand?!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.500
I'm sorry.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:47.710
Washizu-dono, please rest while I'm at it.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.710
Washizu-dono?

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.630
Don't make fun of me.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:57.760
You won't do a thousand while I've only done four hundred.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.970
We should be doing the same amount!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.010
Washizu-dono.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.470
Wassan!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.270
All right, let's go.

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.850
401.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.110
402.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.400
403.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.480
404.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.480
What are they doing?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:23.200
Karasuma Yoichi, do you feel it?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.460
Is my will to kill reaching you?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.960
For some reason, something amusing's happening at the dojo.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.960
613.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.960
Yeah, I can hear their voices all the way over here.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.460
614.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:39.180
It's been pretty lively ever since Yoichi-san came.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.050
615.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:39.720
Yeah.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.640
616.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.720
Although with that, our budget has increased too.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.470
But it's lively and fun.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.470
617.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.930
That's very true.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.600
618.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.190
619.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.780
620.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.530
Yeah, I like mine this thick.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.410
621.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.030
So, what do you want me to help you with?

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.950
779.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:08.710
780.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.290
No.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.670
I can't go on.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.830
781.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.830
Why am I doing this?

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.840
782.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.340
No more.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.220
Isn't it enough that I've done this much?

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.340
I've done well.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:27.720
Wassan.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.270
Washizu-kun, you did well.

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.230
You're amazing to start off with this much.

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:38.990
Ikaruga-san.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.740
That was impressive.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.990
It's not embarrassing at all.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.990
No, no!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.790
787.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.040
787.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.040
Wassan!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.880
It's done.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.840
998.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.090
999.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:03.590
1000!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.640
This ends today's training.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:12.560
I'm never coming again.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.730
That was pretty good, newbie.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.900
Yeah, impressive, old man.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:18.070
Hey, kids!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:22.820
I'm not a newbie nor an old man.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.570
Call me Wassan.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.370
Wassan!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.120
Great job.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.370
Get off me, Torigaya!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.460
Wassan, you really did a great job!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.790
Are you done?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.290
Really great job!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:36.540
Here's a welcoming feast.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.760
Okay, this ends today's lesson.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:42.050
Let's all have dinner.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:45.050
Thanks for the food!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.930
Did you make all of these, Kagome?

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:46.800
Yeah.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.680
You're really good.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.020
Thanks.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.980
These are really good.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.770
Here, open your mouth.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:00.980
Is it good?

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.110
Yes.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.150
I'm so glad I'm alive.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.660
I love this dojo.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.370
Hey, samurai.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.370
Ayame-dono.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.580
Since you can't do it yourself, I'll help you.

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.410
Here open your mouth.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:18.630
It's good.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.710
Don't say it so loudly.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.710
It's already loud enough as it is.

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.170
My humble apologies.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:28.800
I seem to be a little excited today.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.180
Having many people like this is a very nice thing.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:36.270
And you also came to the dojo today.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.690
I only came!

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:40.440
Just shut up and eat!

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:44.950
Though we did go a little over budget, today's a special day.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.240
Yeah, I'm sure it's fine.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:52.740
If we just keep laughing, I'm sure we'll have even more fun.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:56.460
Karasuma Yoichi,

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.290
where are you?!

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:03.550
Goodness, all the assassins he hires are...

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:08.300
Is it finally, finally, my turn to act?

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:28.030
I regret not realizing

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:28.030
taisetsuna hito datte wakarazu ni

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:35.600
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:35.600
sugoshiteta imamade ga kuyashiiyo

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:43.160
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:43.160
jibun kara iwanakucha dame nanda

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:52.620
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:52.620
itsumademo itsumademo koko ni ite kienaide

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:56.850
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:56.650 --> 00:23:00.610
Make me hesitate a little

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:07.600
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:07.680
kokoro hirake kanashimi toki hanatsu shunkan wa

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:11.470
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:15.320
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.670
You're not alone

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:22.000
Because I love you

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:26.610
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:30.030
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:30.030
kitto soba ni hohoemu kara

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:37.630
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:42.770
Next Episode!

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:43.440
Hey, Yoichi!

00:23:42.770 --> 00:24:07.800
Seventh Longsword

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:45.270
Are you training?!

00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:48.990
You see, I'm...

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:50.990
...I'm so lonely I could die.

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:52.240
What?

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:56.280
You're going to the beach with the girls in the next episode?!

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:56.740
Swimsuit?!

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:58.120
Is this what it's about?!

00:23:58.120 --> 00:23:59.290
You're going in a slump?

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:00.540
Unbelievable.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:01.410
You're unbelievable.

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.380
I mean...

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:06.500
you're staying home and doing 100,000 swings!

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.800
By the way, Yoichi,

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:11.050
where is my swimsuit?

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.820
Don't miss the next episode!
